    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n94349" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σῑτ-έω</span></b> , part. gen. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σιτεόντων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Nat. Hom.</u>
					9
				</span></i>
			 (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σιτευμένων</span>
			): aor. 1
			part.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σιτήσας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hsch.
				</span></i>
			:—elsewh. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σιτέομαι</span></b> , 
				Ion.
			
			impf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σιτέσκοντο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					24.209
				</span></i>
			: fut.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σιτήσομαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Nu.</u>
					491
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Pax</u>
				724
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mu.</u>
				400b19
			</span></i>: aor.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐσιτήθην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					5(1).51.1
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Laconia</span>); poet. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σιτήθην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					9.26
				</span></i>
			: (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σῖτος</span>):—<i>take food,
				eat</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλίσιον ἐν τῷ σιτέσκοντο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
				</span></i>
			 l.c., cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.94
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				133
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ap.</u>
				36d
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ ἐν τῷ Μουσείῳ σιτούμενοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>BGU</u>
					73.4
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. acc., <i>feed on, eat</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰχθῦς, καρποὺς σιτέεσθαι</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.200
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				202
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				71
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλπίδας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					1668
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπομαγδαλιάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Eq.</u>
					414
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν σοφίαν</span>
			Id.<u>Nu.</u> l.c.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅπως, οἷς αὐτὸς σιτοῖτο σίτοις,
					τούτοις ὅμοια παρατίθοιτο αὐτῦͅ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Cyr.</u>
					8.2.3
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρέας ς</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
			</span></i> l.c. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>eat of</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπό τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hld.
					2.23
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Scymn.
				854
			</span></i>.</div>
